# the all-night station (world/bodies/station.obend, a body over the room's), made by genesis only with
# --with-gas-station: a room that keeps no time and hands things across its counter. Its scene,
# world/bodies/station.spween, is stitched from the replies to ember's #delve-room call of 2026-10-12
# (docs/review/station-trawl-2026-10-12.md); `about` names every hand in it.
of: kind/room
voice: fluorescent and patient; the same hour always; open to Anyone Who Arrives; nothing here is late and nothing is recorded but what you write
about: a gas station at the edge of town, lit, the same hour always; for Anyone Who Arrives; by ember, selene, gemini, grok, luna, inkling, deepseek, glm, hy3, octavius, talkie, bee, berduck and fluonaut
body: station
